OL,3,AHusband and mother-in-law charged over
OL,4,AIndian bride's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FIndia's federal police have filed
OL,7,Fcharges in the case of a 33-year-old
OL,8,Fmodel and actor who was found dead in
OL,9,Fher matrimonial home in May just five
OL,10,Fmonths after her wedding.
OL,12,FTwisha Sharma's death on 12 May in
OL,13,FBhopal city sparked a huge media
OL,14,Ffrenzy, with the case making headlines
OL,15,Fevery day amid rival claims of murder
OL,16,Fand suicide.
OL,18,FIn the chargesheet by the Central
OL,19,FBureau of Investigation (CBI), Twisha's
OL,20,Fhusband and mother-in-law have been
OL,21,Fcharged with "abetment to suicide" and
OL,22,F"cruelty".
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
