OL,3,AHusband and mother-in-law charged over
OL,4,AIndian bride's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer husband Samarth Singh, a lawyer,
OL,7,Fand mother-in-law Giribala Singh, a
OL,8,Fretired judge, have denied the
OL,9,Fallegations against them.
